  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing Child Labor and Forced Labor in Coffee Supply Chains in Latin America. This project helps businesses establish systems to prevent, detect, and eliminate child labor and other forms of labor exploitation from their supply chains, and it is assembling a powerful coalition of coffee buyers to collectively incentivize suppliers into compliance.</narrative>
